ShareAlike obligation
---------------------
This file is vendored VERBATIM and must stay that way. Category and site-count
filtering happens at RUNTIME in apps/api/services/social_rules.py — never by
editing this file. Modifying it would make the modified version a derivative
work that must itself be released under CC BY-SA 4.0.

If a future change genuinely requires editing the data, that edited file must be
published under CC BY-SA 4.0 with attribution retained.

Refresh
-------
e_string / m_string markers rot as sites redesign. Re-download from upstream and
update the date and commit hash above; re-run the site survey that picked the
broad-tier list before trusting the new copy.
